Package: nbzinbreg
Title: Negative Binomial and Zero-Inflated Negative Binomial Regression
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Jaxson", "Bugg", , "buggjm@miamioh.edu", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Fits negative binomial (NB2) regression by iteratively
    reweighted least squares (IRLS) for the regression coefficients,
    alternated with Newton-Raphson for the dispersion parameter, and
    zero-inflated negative binomial regression by an EM algorithm whose
    M-steps are IRLS fits. No general-purpose optimizer is used. Results
    are checked against the reference implementations in 'MASS' and
    'pscl'.
